cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use UltrafastEngine in published work, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "UltrafastEngine"
type: software
version: 2.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-08
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/JosephCodemard/UltrafastEngine"
url: "https://josephcodemard.github.io/UltrafastEngine/"
abstract: >-
  UltrafastEngine simulates nonlinear ultrashort-pulse propagation through complete table-top optical systems
  (stretchers, compressors, amplifiers, multi-pass cells, fibres, crystals, gas cells, mirrors, coatings) and reads the
  result out with virtual instruments (spectrometer, autocorrelator, FROG, d-scan, cross-correlator, cameras).
authors:
  - family-names: Codemard
    given-names: Joseph
    email: jac318@bath.ac.uk
keywords:
  - ultrafast optics
  - nonlinear optics
  - pulse propagation
  - femtosecond lasers
  - simulation
